efreshing — add the lemon slice halfway for a fresh twist.\n\n南港LaLaport5階にあるHiro’sらぁ麵Kitchen Expressは、本場福岡の豚骨ラーメンと日式とんかつ定食を提供。100％天然スープは濃厚で後味すっきり。途中でレモンを加えると爽やかな風味が広がります。"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-D4MZ3oAmxFU/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/NEZw8aHW2F0/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,[[0,"拉麵店"],"查看相似地點"],[1],"臺北市南港區環河里",null,null,null,null,[[["CgIgAQ\u003d\u003d","0ahUKEwiro-2HxdKWAxU7cfUHHYuvMaUQhbADCIECKAA","全部",[["CIABIhDQ2JSIQs0JaQlK75aTMznL",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWn2lMVlueFxTO-nQLjlnMxzEyr98VzJZuh1SxHDmQOGC-6DGJTORhbodgZVxVCkaauErC1uoxwi73JVReVJRGZqpOyJzFtuKppLtPV8f35ErwMgr3akZ2BKD3RB4XFDdnt14-3JTY8eXfw4\u003dw446-h298-k-no","",[5917,3945],[203,100]],null,[[3,121.61691099999999,25.059027099999998],[0,90],[5917,3945],75],"KHmZaqvvIrvi1e8Pi9_GqQo","0ahUKEwiro-2HxdKWAxU7cfUHHYuvMaUQzCcIggIoAA",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[10,"CIABIhDQ2JSIQs0JaQlK75aTMznL"],[10,3,[3945,5917]],null,null,[[[2],[[null,null,25.059027099999998,121.61691099999999]]]],[1,null,null,[7],null,[null,null,"bizbuilder:gmb_on_local_universal_desktop",[6,7,4,1,3]],null,null,[2025,11,3,13]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["UGCS_REFERENCE","CIABIhDQ2JSIQs0JaQlK75aTMznL||","1"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["3765762455922406035","-8231662813600674973"],null,"4Ts5qQ85ol0"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,0,1,null,0],["CgIgARICGAI\u003d","0ahUKEwiro-2HxdKWAxU7cfUHHYuvMaUQhbADCIMCKAE","最新",[["CIABIhArKlma5Z-hElhxPphCtniR",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWmACIvfZs7dGykVG6GwCeT0u5IBHjmqKyohKuoQcAU0hP7ZFxp-c64sf_42iLW_dLRiQH1iJk5gKs9vmf0qhwW0FQoSNZOGJUSwmpxv-cCHZwGJ69_Lj0Y5mYQ1bMSp5VGaP3jqy4iosf4\u003dw224-h298-k-no","",[1108,1476],[203,100]],null,[[3,121.61691099999999,25.0